<title>USA: Rottlund revises fiscal Q4 sales upward.</title>
<headline>Rottlund revises fiscal Q4 sales upward.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rottlund Co Inc on Friday reported revised fiscal fourth quarter sales of $46.071 million, up from $38.074 million reported earlier this week.</p>
<p>Other figures for the fiscal fourth quarter ended March 31 remain unchanged, the company said. Rottlund reported a net loss of $668,000, or $0.11 a share, versus a profit of $1.171 million or $0.21 a share last year.</p>
<p>Rottlund provides detached single family home and attached townhomes and villas.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
